<description>&lt;p&gt;Malian forces and their Russian allies are carrying out drone strikes that have killed dozens of civilians, with Human Rights Watch reporting 94 civilian deaths. Both the Malian army and rebel groups are also accused of committing abuses against civilians. Burkina Faso, Niger and Mali have resumed talks with ECOWAS after a withdrawal, indicating a diplomatic engagement alongside the violence. The conflict continues to generate high battle-related deaths, with 4,159 deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMimgFBVV95cUxQekJZS0Nab2NieDNYRjhYdU1xQXduZ1pwUGREVjdKZl96eWV1TGdrSEJPOUJVODlZdnpmVUJ4eVNFZXpxZk5zY1dESlUxWDVZSnNueXVsTVFRY0V0djFRSEtibDMyOURzT3FUaFV6ekUzejVuQVJMR2VlRGh2THZWUUI5cEtvdnZUYzg0Qm8ycUctMGVHVWo1QnRR?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Guardian Nigeria News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiUEFVX3lxTE02cm84NWlBMVVSV1NFa1ZqQ0dEUy1LMVVMWkNhMUpmcV9Lc1J5cnlRMUlFLWVzWndzcHozUUpJanpqaEFIUDZNQzliWERNUFNh?oc=5&quot;&gt;ASIAN SCHOLAR | Sass Rogando Sasot&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiqAFBVV95cUxPZFNNdVVQYW5BS2dDbl9rZGJtdF9jdXpfVDFHUmpka1J0aFdoQzA2T3M2V04tMm1FaUEtaFpxcm1IWDZpdldncUUyR1liRFF5TmNRQTBZY1hPMnIweUVkYkJIX0d4dG5MQTA3d0ptMkUwVVFaQ1pHSzdBSkpiWlRxc3k1ZjNKREE1M1o2elNOTVBKVVJQOE9TVUlvSWgtME12bjNOSzZRY2k?oc=5&quot;&gt;Nigerian Bulletin&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiugFBVV95cUxNRUN0akNkRThidC05VWtlcUVXSTlaUG43a3Y5YnM0eU1qdmEyQnd6VmpvTjU1cUsxbG9yVnZoS3JDZEpuU2Fmajd0X1BZSFVzcV80T2hKc0d1ZkE4cWVHa0QzT1pySWFLbWR0bFh2S1RJVWxnWXEtZ2VTZ01rcGt1SFNUMm5vNVBTenRxYl9xZ1FxX0xsZ0U1UDlfV2JmZHdvT2d1TjVYckg2MENsR2lsbWVrQWptRVNETkE?oc=5&quot;&gt;RFI&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/